pare_first_server.yml, restore_etcd.yml, prepare_join_remaining_nodes.yml, rolling_restart_servers.yml, rolling_restart_agents.yml, rolling_restart_config_change.yml, final_steps.yml) are present in the appropriate directories.\n- Handlers and notifications are used to trigger the installation of RKE2 after the download is complete. Please ensure that the handler for "Install RKE2" is defined in the same playbook or in a separate file that gets included in the playbook.\n- This playbook assumes that the necessary variables (ha_mode_enabled, rke2_version) are defined either in the inventory file, vars_files, or group_vars.\n- The playbook assumes that the necessary software (kubectl) is installed and available in the system\'s PATH.\n- This playbook assumes that the necessary permissions are granted to the user executing the playbook to perform all the tasks.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'codestral:22b', 'created_at': '2025-10-23T06:14:42.836661331Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 18589147736, 'load_duration': 19949062, 'prompt_eval_count': 832, 'prompt_eval_duration': 590096252, 'eval_count': 896, 'eval_duration': 17978155529, 'model_name': 'codestral:22b'} id='run--8f99372a-9567-479d-b4a1-2edd896b5294-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 832, 'output_tokens': 896, 'total_tokens': 1728}
